HEADER;
/* Front idler of an excavator track (20 t class): a plain wheel of 291.8 mm tread radius, under the bushings of a 190 mm pitch track with 1 mm of clearance on the pitch circle of the sprocket (322.3 mm), bore 200 mm, 60 mm wide. Axis along z through the origin, the middle of its width at z = 0. In millimeters. Written by scripts/make_track_step.py for the tests of contact on STEP surfaces. */
